    <node id="Deployment Roadmap">
      <data key="d0">Deployment Roadmap</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Deployment Roadmap outlines the planned phases for implementing the selected technology solutions across various sites within the enterprise.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deployment Roadmap is a strategic plan detailing how digitalization tools will be implemented in the customer's operations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deployment Roadmap details the strategy for implementing solutions across various sites and enterprises, outlining project phases based on the initiative's scope.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deployment Roadmap outlines the strategy and steps necessary for implementing a manufacturing execution system (MES) and its integration with other systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deployment Roadmap outlines the strategy and timeline for implementing solutions across various sites.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployment Roadmap provides a timeline and milestones for the project's implementation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deployment Roadmap outlines the schedule and steps for executing project activities, ensuring alignment with customer objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deployment Roadmap provides a detailed plan for executing project activities, ensuring alignment with customer timelines and objectives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-57aa665558a17724e5760332bec68a52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fb30dd05d6733395e35883cf05930fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf709b3eff7c37be730b0544a32ffe2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ea3c4866a070e16f8e1402c2ee6a9b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1867d04595ed4c739d2ab884043cc2fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ada47bebdfb0936d4c76944190b7b48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1f46454562875f5de23d46e56265cd</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Stakeholder Interviews">
      <data key="d0">Stakeholder Interviews</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Stakeholder Interviews are conducted to gather insights and information from the customer’s team during the assessment process.&lt;SEP&gt;Stakeholder interviews are a key part of the DxDiscovery process, capturing insights and requirements from involved parties.&lt;SEP&gt;Stakeholder Interviews are discussions conducted by RoviSys to gather insights from personnel involved in the manufacturing process.</data>
