    <node id="Legacy System Review">
      <data key="d0">Legacy System Review</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Legacy System Review involves evaluating older systems to identify their functions, challenges, and areas for improvement in the context of digitalization initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Legacy System Review involves understanding existing legacy systems and applications in a manufacturing enterprise to ensure comprehensive digitalization.&lt;SEP&gt;The Legacy System Review assesses existing systems that the customer currently uses to identify areas for improvement.&lt;SEP&gt;Legacy System Review is a process of evaluating existing legacy systems within manufacturing to identify opportunities for replacement or enhancement.&lt;SEP&gt;Legacy System Review is the process of evaluating existing legacy systems within manufacturing to identify opportunities for replacement or enhancement.&lt;SEP&gt;The Legacy System Review is an assessment conducted to understand current manufacturing processes and constraints, focusing on legacy systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fcb6f4feca83c07291b62233b516b103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed9a51a167b57c0284fd4f9ec0851587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ea3c4866a070e16f8e1402c2ee6a9b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8da747f3ceec4453ba07d55c8b9a6eee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ada47bebdfb0936d4c76944190b7b48</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Smart Manufacturing Delivery RET">
