      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Assessment Phase involves evaluating project requirements and constraints to inform planning and execution.&lt;SEP&gt;The Assessment Phase is the first stage in the Smart Manufacturing Delivery process, focusing on evaluating current processes and defining the digitalization strategy.</data>
