    <node id="DxDiscovery">
      <data key="d0">DxDiscovery</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">DxDiscovery is a product offering aimed at gathering information to shape project engagements and recommendations for future initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;DxDiscovery is a productized offering that forms part of the Assessment Phase, aimed at establishing the current process state and rationale for digitalization.&lt;SEP&gt;DxDiscovery is an initiative by RoviSys aimed at assessing current processes and identifying opportunities for digitalization within customer operations.&lt;SEP&gt;DxDiscovery refers to a discovery effort aimed at assessing and making recommendations for digitalization initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;DxDiscovery is a product offering from RoviSys aimed at gathering information to shape engagement and provide recommendations for digitalization initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;DxDiscovery is an initiative aimed at assessing and improving customer systems and processes, involving stakeholder interviews and analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;DxDiscovery refers to a specific methodology or framework used in conducting stakeholder interviews and gathering project insights.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1ef82bed5a61b39c5a2e6f0138253bf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c16ba401c33ac9567f9c7d577af7d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5a2d45a0a547f958cfeefdf6da7677a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8e304661cfd6124f3e9b284ba45f064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4f3730c01981af7f97db24dadc4bfe1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d3f4724ce763157782acd3baecf1b27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8da747f3ceec4453ba07d55c8b9a6eee</data>
