    <node id="Solution Architect">
      <data key="d0">Solution Architect</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Solution Architect collaborates with the Project Manager and Technical Lead to customize the onboarding checklist.&lt;SEP&gt;The Solution Architect defines the architecture of technology solutions to meet customer needs and project requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Solution Architect designs technical architectures and provides advice on technology platform options.&lt;SEP&gt;The Solution Architect is engaged primarily at the start of the project to define architectures and interface specifications.&lt;SEP&gt;The Solution Architect is responsible for designing the technical architecture of the solution in alignment with project goals.&lt;SEP&gt;The Solution Architect collaborates with the Project Manager and Technical Lead to ensure project requirements are met.&lt;SEP&gt;The Solution Architect designs the overall system architecture, ensuring alignment with business goals and scalability.&lt;SEP&gt;The Solution Architect is consulted for architectural decisions and helps in creating the execution architecture for projects.</data>
