      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The ISA-95 Model is a framework for integrating enterprise and control systems, which outlines various layers of digitalization in operations management.&lt;SEP&gt;The ISA-95 model is a standard for integrating enterprise and control systems, defining levels of manufacturing operations management.</data>
