      <data key="d2">The Stakeholder Group Interview Process aims to gather insights for formulating business process scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;The Stakeholder Group Interview Process is a method used by RoviSys to gather insights from key personnel about current processes and potential improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Stakeholder Group Interview Process is a structured approach to gather insights from various stakeholders to inform business process improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Stakeholder Group Interview Process is a structured approach for interviewing key individuals within an organization to gather insights for project development.</data>
