      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">SCADA (Supervisory Control and Data Acquisition) refers to systems used for controlling industrial processes and collecting real-time data.&lt;SEP&gt;Supervisory Control and Data Acquisition (SCADA) systems are used for industrial control systems to monitor and control physical processes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11c16ba401c33ac9567f9c7d577af7d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab2d11ba1cd77118f527559769a52464</data>
