      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Operations Management Capability Review provides an overview of the capabilities offered by MES and MOM applications in the context of digitalization.&lt;SEP&gt;The Operations Management Capability Review is an assessment conducted as part of the DxDiscovery to evaluate the customer's operational capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Operations Management Capability Review is an assessment to evaluate and enhance the capabilities of operations management within a facility.&lt;SEP&gt;The Operations Management Capability Review is an assessment initiative aimed at evaluating the operational capabilities of the customer's enterprise.&lt;SEP&gt;The Operations Management Capability Review assesses the capabilities delivered by the MES initiative and aligns them with customer needs.</data>
