    <node id="February 7, 2024">
      <data key="d0">February 7, 2024</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">February 7, 2024 is the date mentioned in relation to the MES Deployment Roadmap formulation, marking a significant point in the project timeline.&lt;SEP&gt;February 7, 2024 is the date mentioned in the document, associated with the publication of guidance and definitions related to MES.&lt;SEP&gt;February 7, 2024, is a date mentioned in the context of a project timeline for stakeholder interviews and RACI items.&lt;SEP&gt;February 7, 2024, is the date when the operations management capability review and related assessments are scheduled to take place.&lt;SEP&gt;February 7, 2024, is a date referenced in the context of preparing the Executive Summary Presentation and discussing perceived benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;February 7, 2024, is a date referenced in the context of the perceived benefits and executive summary documentation.&lt;SEP&gt;February 7, 2024, is the date mentioned for the publication of the MES RIS 102.5 - Generic Architecture document.&lt;SEP&gt;February 7, 2024, is the date referenced for a specific document or meeting related to the technology selection process.&lt;SEP&gt;February 7, 2024, marks the date of the deployment roadmap formulation meeting.</data>
