      <data key="d0">Plant Manager</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Plant Manager is responsible for overseeing the operations and management of a manufacturing plant, ensuring efficiency and productivity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Plant Manager is responsible for overseeing the operations of the manufacturing plant and is a key stakeholder in the process assessment.</data>
