      <data key="d2">The DxArchitecture effort focuses on defining how digitalization can be applied to enhance plant processes and replace outdated systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The DxArchitecture effort focuses on defining how digitalization can enhance plant efficiency and replace outdated systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-95c578743c1a5b9a5c0b24ae18da2647</data>
