    <node id="DxLean effort">
      <data key="d0">DxLean effort</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The DxLean effort aims to identify and implement process improvements to increase efficiency and reduce waste, independent of digital solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;The DxLean effort is aimed at identifying process improvements to increase efficiency and reduce waste without relying on digitalization.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-95c578743c1a5b9a5c0b24ae18da2647</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
    </node>
