      <data key="d0">Generic Architecture Formulation</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Generic Architecture Formulation is the process of outlining system interactions and touchpoints within the digitalization framework for manufacturing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5e1f46454562875f5de23d46e56265cd</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
