    <node id="Technology Selection Process">
      <data key="d0">Technology Selection Process</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Technology Selection Process involves evaluating criteria to justify the selection of technology solutions for manufacturing operations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technology Selection Process is an activity aimed at evaluating and selecting technology platforms that meet specific process scenarios and ROI expectations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technology Selection Process involves choosing the appropriate technology stack for a project based on customer requirements and project goals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-57aa665558a17724e5760332bec68a52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a7eb0fb8f3cffd7e149a5eb5fa494de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1f46454562875f5de23d46e56265cd</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Solution Architecture Definition">
      <data key="d0">Solution Architecture Definition</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Solution Architecture Definition outlines the specific architecture required for a project to meet the business objectives and technical requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Solution Architecture Definition provides clarity on the selected digitalization solution stack and its integration into the enterprise landscape.&lt;SEP&gt;The Solution Architecture Definition provides clarity on the digitalization solution stack and its integration within the customer's enterprise landscape.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-57aa665558a17724e5760332bec68a52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08b58cce13a77657fb11aba10f8dae43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1f46454562875f5de23d46e56265cd</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ROI Guidance Formulation">
      <data key="d0">ROI Guidance Formulation</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">ROI Guidance Formulation involves providing customers with guidelines on how proposed solutions can yield a return on investment, emphasizing the importance of accurate calculations based on specific knowledge of costs.&lt;SEP&gt;ROI Guidance Formulation offers insights into how proposed solutions can deliver a return on investment for customers.&lt;SEP&gt;ROI Guidance Formulation provides customers with methods to calculate the expected return on investment for their digitalization initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;ROI Guidance Formulation is the process of assessing the expected returns on investment for a project, crucial for project justification.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-57aa665558a17724e5760332bec68a52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ed577d3078c7fcd6f48adbbc3eb2b23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08b58cce13a77657fb11aba10f8dae43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1f46454562875f5de23d46e56265cd</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Deployment Roadmap Formulation">
      <data key="d0">Deployment Roadmap Formulation</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Deployment Roadmap Formulation outlines the plan for implementing the solution stack across the enterprise based on the initiative's scope.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5e1f46454562875f5de23d46e56265cd</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Production Processes">
      <data key="d0">Production Processes</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Production Processes refer to the series of activities and systems involved in the manufacturing of products, often visualized in a structured format to clarify interactions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5e1f46454562875f5de23d46e56265cd</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Swimlane Format">
      <data key="d0">Swimlane Format</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Swimlane Format is a visual representation used to illustrate the responsibilities of different systems and users in production processes, enhancing clarity in process mapping.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5e1f46454562875f5de23d46e56265cd</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
    </node>
