      <data key="d0">Business Process Scenario</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Business Process Scenario outlines specific processes within the project that need to be addressed or improved.&lt;SEP&gt;Business Process Scenarios are specific instances of processes that can be documented using the SIPOC methodology.&lt;SEP&gt;Business Process Scenarios are structured representations of workflows that help organizations streamline their operations and decision-making.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-846cea9a9548723f6999d6e522d8bb41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-298e2208d65e4784732a75d14634bc9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ada47bebdfb0936d4c76944190b7b48</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
    </node>
