      <data key="d0">PowerPoint</data>
      <data key="d1">equipment</data>
      <data key="d2">PowerPoint is a software tool used for creating SIPOC diagrams and presentations related to business processes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-846cea9a9548723f6999d6e522d8bb41</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SIPOC">
      <data key="d0">SIPOC</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">SIPOC (Suppliers, Inputs, Process, Outputs, Customers) is a tool used in process mapping to identify key elements of a process.&lt;SEP&gt;SIPOC is a methodology that stands for Suppliers, Inputs, Process, Outputs, and Consumers, used for defining business processes.&lt;SEP&gt;SIPOC is a process mapping tool used to document inputs, processes, and outputs, particularly in business process management.&lt;SEP&gt;SIPOC is a process mapping tool that stands for Suppliers, Inputs, Process, Outputs, and Customers, used to define and clarify project scope.&lt;SEP&gt;SIPOC is a tool used to define Suppliers, Inputs, Process, Outputs, and Customers in process management, aiding in user story creation.&lt;SEP&gt;SIPOC is a tool used to outline the Inputs, Process, Outputs, Customers, and Suppliers involved in a project, facilitating clarity in project management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce656892960bdf19bad87a40627f43b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57aa665558a17724e5760332bec68a52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d120b178baf3ca897f1a7c5fe4186ea2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-846cea9a9548723f6999d6e522d8bb41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f71e5a295481a80d1839f4ba2e4c08a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3b35b16f5ace6b0f6122269577fa160</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Process Suppliers">
      <data key="d0">Process Suppliers</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Process Suppliers refer to the entities or individuals that provide the necessary inputs for a business process.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-846cea9a9548723f6999d6e522d8bb41</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
    </node>
