    <node id="Functional Analyst">
      <data key="d0">Functional Analyst</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Functional Analyst assists in understanding project requirements and works closely with the Project Manager and other roles.&lt;SEP&gt;The Functional Analyst facilitates business process scenarios and user story refinement, supporting the project throughout its lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;The Functional Analyst typically acts in a supporting role throughout the project lifecycle, assisting with user support activities and translating user requirements into technical designs.&lt;SEP&gt;The Functional Analyst plays a role in understanding and analyzing business requirements within the project context.&lt;SEP&gt;The Functional Analyst is responsible for analyzing business requirements and ensuring they are addressed in project execution.&lt;SEP&gt;The Functional Analyst translates business requirements into functional specifications for the development team, ensuring software meets user needs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1a9d7d2ecf271ed81769261c1db2dfc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57aa665558a17724e5760332bec68a52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d120b178baf3ca897f1a7c5fe4186ea2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4916fbc7a1867b2372c62212ff631c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2ca61d778c3370a56ae750bfa77466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-985700d6939a1f7f1a71db6f2f1f92f3</data>
