    <node id="Technical Lead">
      <data key="d0">Technical Lead</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Technical Lead is involved in tailoring the onboarding checklist for specific projects and is consulted during the onboarding process.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical Lead is involved in translating user stories into technical designs and guiding the development team throughout the project.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical Lead plays a critical role in translating user stories into technical design and guiding the development team throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical Lead is responsible for overseeing technical aspects and ensuring the project's technical requirements are met.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical Lead is responsible for reviewing infrastructure evaluations and conducting legacy system reviews to inform project strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical Lead oversees technical aspects of projects, ensuring proper integration of technology and architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical Lead supports the Project Manager and is involved in various project activities, including proposal reviews and meetings.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical Lead provides technical direction and oversight to the development team, ensuring best practices are followed.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical Lead is responsible for outlining the technological components required for project execution and ensuring alignment with customer requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical Lead is responsible for creating recommendations for code management standards and informing the project team about the code management strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical Lead oversees the audit process and ensures that the audit checklist is tailored specifically to the project requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1a9d7d2ecf271ed81769261c1db2dfc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ce8aa2923b09c026dd159f411698ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57aa665558a17724e5760332bec68a52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d120b178baf3ca897f1a7c5fe4186ea2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4916fbc7a1867b2372c62212ff631c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-930089a1f69bb72daa22a86ca0b5e2d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5b2dbfddced5b4824e0bafd280a9684&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2ca61d778c3370a56ae750bfa77466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-985700d6939a1f7f1a71db6f2f1f92f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ada47bebdfb0936d4c76944190b7b48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77fef134e3ad44458e6de317489e99b</data>
