    <node id="Work Breakdown Schedule (WBS)">
      <data key="d0">Work Breakdown Schedule (WBS)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Work Breakdown Schedule (WBS) is a hierarchical decomposition of a project into smaller components, aiding in project planning and resource management.&lt;SEP&gt;The Work Breakdown Schedule (WBS) is a structured approach to breaking down project scope into manageable components for better planning and execution.&lt;SEP&gt;The Work Breakdown Schedule is a structured approach for developing project schedules by breaking down work into manageable tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Work Breakdown Schedule is a structured approach to breaking down project work into manageable tasks, enhancing accuracy in timelines and resource allocation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce656892960bdf19bad87a40627f43b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b7cdd60303ffc2288c6e89a324a39fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-930089a1f69bb72daa22a86ca0b5e2d8</data>
