    <node id="User Story">
      <data key="d0">User Story</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A User Story is a brief description of a feature from the perspective of the end user, outlining requirements and acceptance criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;A User Story is a brief, self-contained unit of work written from the end user's perspective to explain the value of a software feature.&lt;SEP&gt;A user story is a brief, simple description of a feature from the perspective of the end user, focusing on their needs and the value delivered.&lt;SEP&gt;A User Story is a brief description of a feature from the perspective of the end-user, used in agile development to capture requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d120b178baf3ca897f1a7c5fe4186ea2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce656892960bdf19bad87a40627f43b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f71e5a295481a80d1839f4ba2e4c08a</data>
