      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Architectural Decisions refer to the choices made regarding the technical framework and design of the project, impacting execution and delivery.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-930089a1f69bb72daa22a86ca0b5e2d8</data>
      <data key="d4">RAPs for MES - Development.pdf</data>
