      <data key="d0">Technical Documentation</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Technical Documentation includes records of architectural changes, API updates, and configuration changes for future reference in software projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Technical Documentation records architectural changes, API updates, and configuration changes for future reference.</data>
