      <data key="d2">Beverly Kiglics is a significant contributor and user involved in the approval and revision processes of various documents within the Rovisys system. She has played an active role in approving multiple revisions, including those related to the travel and reimbursement document, lodging expenses, and the Emergency Support Pay policy, which she has approved on several occasions. On December 23, 2022, she approved a revision of the document, and she is also noted for her involvement in the approval process for revisions related to RAP 306 and RAP 301. 

In addition to her approval responsibilities, Beverly has created and edited multiple documents, including the RAP 308 Project Closeout document, shipping templates and instructions, and purchase order documentation. Her contributions indicate a strong role in oversight and management, as she has made edits and corrections to various project-related documents, ensuring quality management and confidentiality. Beverly Kiglics is consistently recognized in documentation as a contributor or reviewer, highlighting her integral role in the documentation processes at Rovisys.</data>
