    <node id="Group Manager">
      <data key="d0">Group Manager</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Group Manager at RoviSys is a management employee who reports to a Director.&lt;SEP&gt;The Group Manager is responsible for overseeing employee time sheets and approving them for accuracy in the Grandview System.&lt;SEP&gt;The Group Manager (GM) communicates employee safety concerns to management and ensures that safety needs are addressed in the future.&lt;SEP&gt;The Group Manager is responsible for discussing violations of safety policies with employees and overseeing compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Group Manager oversees the safety committee and is involved in the review and reporting of incidents.</data>
