      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Employees are individuals working at RoviSys who are required to follow safety guidelines and report inadequate tools.&lt;SEP&gt;Employees are individuals working at RoviSys who must adhere to safety protocols and use PPE as required.&lt;SEP&gt;Employees are individuals working at Rovisys who have the right to stop work if they perceive unsafe conditions or hazards.&lt;SEP&gt;Employees are individuals working for RoviSys who are subject to the company's travel and expense reimbursement policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Employees at RoviSys are required to record their time spent on customer contracts and activities in the Grandview System.&lt;SEP&gt;Employees refer to individuals working at RoviSys who are subject to the company's travel and rental car policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Employees are individuals working within the building who are expected to follow safety procedures and participate in safety inspections and evacuation plans.&lt;SEP&gt;Employees are individuals working within the company who must adhere to safety rules and protocols to ensure their own safety and that of others.&lt;SEP&gt;Employees are individuals working within the company who must follow safety protocols and receive training regarding hazardous materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Employees are responsible for acquiring, maintaining, and using their personal protective equipment as per safety policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Employees are individuals working in manufacturing areas who are at risk of heat-related illnesses and must adhere to safety policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Employees are individuals working within the company who must adhere to safety protocols regarding hazardous materials and training procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;Employees are individuals working for the Company who are subjected to occupational exposure risks and are required to undergo training.</data>
