    <node id="Dave Hermann">
      <data key="d0">Dave Hermann</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dave Hermann contributed to the document by updating information related to the safety manager, showcasing involvement in safety management.&lt;SEP&gt;Dave Hermann contributed to the document by updating the safety manager information.&lt;SEP&gt;Dave Hermann is a user who created or edited multiple revisions of the RAP 321 Forecasting document, including a periodic review.&lt;SEP&gt;Dave Hermann is a user who created or edited multiple revisions of the document, including a periodic review and a promotion to RAP.&lt;SEP&gt;Dave Hermann is an active contributor involved in the development and revision of various documents, demonstrating a significant role in managing project documentation. He has participated in multiple revisions, including substantial edits to the RAP 303 Job Documentation and the RAP 306 document over time. His contributions include fixing tags and editing entries related to job documentation, as well as making various edits and approvals in the Emergency Support Pay policy and its procedures.

On specific dates, Dave Hermann made notable edits, including on February 20, 2020, November 15, 2022, and June 16, 2020. He is recognized for his involvement in the editing process of the RAP 308 Project Closeout document and has contributed to the Rovisys expense reporting documentation. Additionally, he has played a role in creating and editing templates related to RoviSys's processes and has contributed to document revisions on RoviPedia, with a noted edit on December 4, 2014.

Overall, Dave Hermann's extensive engagement in creating, editing, and approving various documentation reflects his commitment to maintaining and enhancing the quality of project-related materials.</data>
