    <node id="GrandView">
      <data key="d0">GrandView</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">GrandView is a database used by RoviSys for storing information associated with completed contracts, including proposals and correspondence.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is a database used by RoviSys for storing information associated with completed contracts, including proposals, purchase orders, and correspondence.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is a system used by RoviSys for logging test equipment information and notifying employees about equipment availability.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is a platform or tool used by RoviSys for project initialization and management, ensuring all billable work is executed through it.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is a project management tool used for tracking project statuses and documentation, including project closure activities.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is a system used for managing purchase orders and approvals within RoviSys.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is a system used by RoviSys for managing purchase orders and vendor interactions.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is a system used by RoviSys for logging received equipment and managing purchase orders and invoices.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is a system used by RoviSys to track jobs, costs, and customer support activities.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is a project management collaboration system used by RoviSys to track project status and manage progress.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is a platform used by RoviSys for project management and customer support tracking.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is an approved system used by RoviSys for storing necessary information related to customer system connections.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is the inventory management system used by RoviSys to log received items and manage inventory.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView refers to the system used for logging received items and managing inventory at RoviSys.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is the location where items are received and where the packing slips are sent.&lt;SEP&gt;GrandView is a project management system used by RoviSys to configure project settings and manage approvals for expenses.</data>
