    <node id="Safety Committee">
      <data key="d0">Safety Committee</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Safety Committee at RoviSys is responsible for training employees in the use of portable fire extinguishers and managing safety protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Committee is responsible for evaluating company operations to ensure adherence to established safety policies and for providing training and feedback to improve safety practices.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Committee is responsible for maintaining safety policies and coordinating safety training and compliance within the company.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Committee is responsible for overseeing safety inspections and ensuring compliance with safety regulations in the building.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Committee maintains lists of hazardous chemicals and oversees safety protocols in the workplace.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Committee is responsible for approving safety equipment and protocols, ensuring a safe working environment for all employees.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Committee is responsible for reviewing and assessing safety concerns raised by employees and ensuring compliance with safety policies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Committee is responsible for ensuring that hazardous chemicals in the building are properly labeled and updated, and for advising employees and contractors on safety protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Committee is responsible for reviewing safety concerns, investigating incidents, and following up on employee safety issues.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Committee is responsible for reviewing first aid stations and ensuring they are adequately supplied.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Committee is responsible for reviewing incidents and ensuring compliance with safety regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Committee is responsible for overseeing safety protocols and addressing incidents related to occupational exposure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-506a088797d7a8f444adb3f7d73e5994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd170496ac759ffa10483e3c499aee62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e630509e1fc1f504bdc55757cf8a297c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c134518973545d46ab93da77be1180f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-287da06ac0c61bfd0327451da0d71006&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba8ed23e340ab44b0624649a53a77ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f0b03f75a7f867c867bd69390331c71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d3eb7fe1ed29d1e6926804ad500424b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c605e63af21bf1c42a8e7f06bc6d6091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9387e3de5b41e8f57a409e11cf74440b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b856e79a9fdc655b4a3f08103bd81b72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f3469830aed586a36a438f2b2204ecb</data>
