      <data key="d2">Safety Policy outlines the procedures and guidelines established by the company to ensure employee safety and compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Policy outlines procedures and practices aimed at preventing workplace accidents related to the use of combustibles, machinery, and hand tools.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Policy outlines the company's commitment to maintaining a safe workplace and minimizing accidents and injuries.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Policy outlines the procedures and responsibilities for maintaining workplace safety, including inspections and training.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Policy outlines the regulations and guidelines for employees to ensure safety in the workplace, including equipment operation and hazard identification.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Policy outlines the procedures and guidelines for safe tool usage and manual handling of materials at RoviSys.</data>
