    <edge source="RoviSys" target="Customer">
      <data key="d5">144.0</data>
      <data key="d6">Customers engage with RoviSys to gain insights and improvements in their operations management capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;RoviSys collaborates with the Customer to conduct the DxDiscovery effort, requiring access to stakeholders and information.&lt;SEP&gt;RoviSys provides assessment services to the Customer to help them leverage digitalization for operational improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;The customer engages RoviSys for digitalization initiatives, expecting clarity on the discovery process and deliverables.&lt;SEP&gt;RoviSys collaborates with the Customer to gather necessary documentation and insights during the discovery workshop.&lt;SEP&gt;RoviSys collaborates with the customer to ensure project deliverables are met and responsibilities are clear through the RACI model.&lt;SEP&gt;The customer engages with RoviSys to explore MES solutions that align with their operational needs and financial goals.&lt;SEP&gt;The Customer engages RoviSys for the Digitalization Initiative and is responsible for providing necessary approvals and feedback.&lt;SEP&gt;RoviSys is collaborating with the customer to establish a framework agreement for a multi-year initiative, indicating a partnership in project execution.&lt;SEP&gt;RoviSys provides technology solutions to the Customer, addressing their specific business objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;The customer relies on RoviSys for support and engages in knowledge transfer to improve system functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;RoviSys provides remote support services to the Customer, including system modifications and documentation of changes made during sessions.</data>
      <data key="d7">client collaboration, service provision&lt;SEP&gt;client engagement, service relationship&lt;SEP&gt;client engagement, solution exploration&lt;SEP&gt;client relationship, project collaboration&lt;SEP&gt;client relationship, service engagement&lt;SEP&gt;client-vendor relationship, collaboration&lt;SEP&gt;collaboration, partnership&lt;SEP&gt;collaboration, project management&lt;SEP&gt;consulting partnership, collaboration&lt;SEP&gt;service provider, client relationship&lt;SEP&gt;service provision, client relationship</data>
